o-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-l4mviy alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Your fish arrives frozen in an eco-friendly, insulated box with the perfect amount of dry ice to keep your seafood frozen until the end of your scheduled delivery day.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="26ee5dae-5af0-437b-8ba7-85d0f145d1c6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1mptqhc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="78d36e7a-4e60-4573-85cd-035eb84876c4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="26ee5dae-5af0-437b-8ba7-85d0f145d1c6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-mevxfy"><div data-rid="06d16c47-8923-4b30-b4e7-59db4b5a5414" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-xcwe2y alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Why a membership?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="6310d847-082e-49b0-a2f0-b184b700691b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1r9icaz"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1dsx5jz"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden=""><div data-rid="9e98c755-e6aa-4ba5-a837-70571339d896" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-4de8js"><div data-rid="0da9d8e5-54f1-440b-aeef-9b9414135197" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-d869iq alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>A Seatopia membership is like a Community Supported Seafood box, bridging the gap between you and sustainable aquafarms. This model allows our farmers to plan their harvests more effectively, promoting a focus on quality and ecosystem health. In line with the Slow Food Movement, we're stepping away from impersonal, commodity-based supply chains. Subscriptions are flexible—you get preferred pricing, and can adjust or cancel anytime. This isn't just about buying seafood; it's a pact for a sustainable, transparent food system.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="0e519e53-fb6d-4749-8d9f-861cb51f5e59" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1ucdz59" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4ae8ac4f-f63d-4c9c-8ae0-75a806ed59e2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="0e519e53-fb6d-4749-8d9f-861cb51f5e59" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-m5xikb"><div data-rid="c8d4dcf7-f5bd-4fbf-816b-8181e03d9676" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-10dsldk alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Why choose farmed instead of wild-caught?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="007839ef-e13c-4b01-8c15-3984439612c1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-jen2xo"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-nu7atl"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden=""><div data-rid="7d82efb8-7c9c-4b75-99b5-e04d8a5f3dd8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="accordion-overflow" id="accordion-overflow" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1n2fp53"><div data-rid="b48d5cec-7224-4971-88a0-5ce4844bf726" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1d5h87u alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Cleaner Profile</strong><br>Thanks to our stringent farming practices, specific species selection, and certified clean feed, our farm-raised seafood contains lower levels of mercury, PCBs, and microplastics compared to many wild-caught alternatives.</p></span></div><div data-rid="2aeadf2f-6fd6-40a3-9d4f-1a0248abee5d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-195lrsg alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Nutrient-Rich</strong><br>Our seafood is higher in essential nutrients and omega-3 fatty acids. This is because we control the diets of our fish to optimize their health benefits, ensuring they are fed a balanced diet rich in the nutrients that matter most.</p></span></div><div data-rid="e61af35f-e279-4a7e-803a-f3cbd60d6b3b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1578246 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Natural Coloring</strong><br>Just like wild-caught fish, the vibrant colors of our farm-raised seafood come from a diet high in antioxidant-rich micro-algae, specifically astaxanthin. This means you're getting a product that's not only beautiful but also natural.</p></span></div><div data-rid="cfa8356f-9ef1-4dfa-8ca7-55f2465d92b6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-c1whht alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>No Antibiotics or Hormones<br></strong>We're committed to raising our seafood without the use of antibiotics or hormones. This aligns with our ethos of providing you with the cleanest, most natural products possible.</p></span></div><div data-rid="2b03449a-9cfc-4f32-a086-33ec8fe65369" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-azipid alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><strong>Sustainability & Scalability</strong><br>Our approach to aquaculture is not only sustainable but also scalable. This ensures that we can continue to provide high-quality seafood while having a minimal impact on marine ecosystems.</p></span></div><div data-rid="16bfbce1-5ef7-4569-9e71-0a210091c11f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-12nzpy2 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>So when you choose Seatopia's farm-raised seafood, you're opting for a product that's superior in quality, nutritional value, and environmental impact. Learn more.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8a33a7b9-4ca2-4966-bb20-e5465ca67a94" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1usxkrr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="24d1dbbf-a500-420a-beac-78cb751bff7e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="8a33a7b9-4ca2-4966-bb20-e5465ca67a94" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1cn2rxk"><div data-rid="3a533ce8-1e4b-49d7-bd26-3aae8939d747" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1ujeqhv alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Can I skip or cancel?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="5fed9b99-85b6-4f09-aff8-a2544ba26806" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-a8r2i1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1b9bup5"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden=""><div data-rid="69d6dc53-ce56-42c6-a66d-16c73d128ee3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-29izz8"><div data-rid="8a486808-00aa-40e4-9deb-95553e21a77d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-v930r8 alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>Yes. You can adjust your delivery schedule, plan type, frequency and even cancel completely through your online account portal. If you'd prefer, chat with us and we'll help 